// [2026-10-05 03:42 +02:00] Add accessible move-up/move-down controls to the In progress feature list that persist each feature's relative ordering in .features and reflect the saved order after refresh; keep High/Medium/Low priority values unchanged.
// [2026-10-05 03:45 +02:00] Replace createApp's positional optional configuration arguments with a typed options object while preserving the required root argument and existing defaults; migrate all configured call sites and verify behavior through existing integration tests.
// [2026-10-05 03:47 +02:00] Record the clarified feature-category decision: support system, client, and server, with system as the default; close the clarification task without changing production behavior.
